Is everything all right?

This feels familiar, doesn't it? The Flaming Lady was created to protect the God of Fire's heart and the whole territory of the Heart of Fire. She will have the answers to all my questions.
This is the Magic Prison used to capture Greedy.

Please, use the Magic Prison to capture the Flaming Lady.

